  "intro": [
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The iCoat-3 is designed to strike a balance between coat and performance. This is selective conformal coating machine comes with a single head and dual valve structure with 3 axis servo control. Optionally, dual or quad valves configuration is a variety of valve arrangements and adapts to the production needs of diverse panels."
    }
  ],
